   - $.httpResponseTemplate: is missing, but is required, if specifying action of type ResponseTemplate
   - $.httpResponses: is missing, but is required, if specifying action of type Responses
   - $.httpSseResponse: is missing, but is required, if specifying action of type SseResponse
   - $.httpWebSocketResponse: is missing, but is required, if specifying action of type WebSocketResponse
   - $.steps: is missing but it is required
